{"version":2,"result":"accepted","signature":"signature Percent\n    scale : (int, int) -> int\n    twice : (int) -> int\n","erased":{"flavor":"ml","source":"// osprey: types=hm\n\nnamespace demo\n\n(** Percentages the discipline accepts. *)\nmodule Percent\n    (** `p` percent of `total`, for `p` between zero and one hundred. *)\n    export scale (p, total) = intDiv (total * p, 100)\n\n    (** Literal and bounded-parameter calls, both inside the bound. *)\n    export twice total = intDiv (scale (50, total) + scale (25 + 25, 400), 2)\n"},"diagnostics":[]}
